{
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_55_mh_powerful_monster_pop.txt/0": "\\>强力敌人出现了！！",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_57_item_area.txt/0": "咦？这一带好像\r\n掉落了非常多道具……",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_57_item_area.txt/1": "是谁掉在这里的吗……？\r\n还是从哪里飞来的……？",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_57_item_area.txt/2": "不管怎样，运气真好！\r\n赶紧补充物资吧。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_58_item_area_end.txt/0": "\\>道具掉落率\r\n恢复正常了。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_59_enemy_area.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，等一下！\r\n前面的地区绝对很危险。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_59_enemy_area.txt/1": "这里魔物很多，要小心！",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_60_enemy_area_end.txt/0": "\\>平安闯过去了！\r\n敌人出现率\r\n恢复正常！",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_61_unknown_rate_up.txt/0": "咦？光之灾厄的样子有点……。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_61_unknown_rate_up.txt/1": "哇！\r\n这是什么？雾、雾吗？",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_61_unknown_rate_up.txt/2": "看起来不会伤害我们，不过……\r\n总之……谨慎前进吧。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_61_unknown_rate_up.txt/3": "\\>人和魔物更容易\r\n变成“???”的未识别状态！\r\n你无法分清谁是敌是友！",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_62_unknown_rate_up_end.txt/0": "\\>光之灾厄的薄雾\r\n已经散去。识别率\r\n恢复正常。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_63_good_effect.txt/0": "啊，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，等等！\r\n那边传来一股\r\n惊人的能量！",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_63_good_effect.txt/1": "站到那里，也许能消除\r\n旅途的疲劳……",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_63_good_effect.txt/2": "你站到了梅莫莉娅指定的地方。\r\n大地的能量治愈了\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]受伤的身体！！",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_63_good_effect.txt/3": "力量涌上了\\>\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]！\r\nHP和EN恢复。此外，攻击\r\n与防御也会暂时提升！",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_67_darkness_slow_end.txt/0": "\\>光之灾厄摆脱了术法，\r\n恢复了正常速度。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_68_change_country_msg.txt/0": "你回到了\\>\\c[52]先民国\r\n\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_68_change_country_msg.txt/1": "你正在接近\r\n\\>\\c[52]先民\\c[0]灵魂聚集的地方！",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_68_change_country_msg.txt/2": "你看见了\\>\\c[52]异国\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_68_change_country_msg.txt/3": "你正在接近\r\n\\>\\c[52]异国之人\\c[0]灵魂聚集的地方！",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_68_change_country_msg.txt/4": "你看见了\r\n\\>\\c[52]半兽人之国\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_68_change_country_msg.txt/5": "你正在接近\r\n\\>\\c[52]半兽人\\c[0]灵魂聚集的地方！",
  "choice/data/event/timer/udb24_69_every_50km_event.txt/526": "梦之尽头！_前往\\c[52]结局\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/timer/udb24_69_every_50km_event.txt/584": "这里不是尽头。_继续前进\\c[52]1000km\\c[0]",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_69_every_50km_event.txt/0": "这次一定……。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_69_every_50km_event.txt/1": "这里就是……。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_69_every_50km_event.txt/2": "对，这里不是尽头……。\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的旅程还会继续！",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_69_every_50km_event.txt/3": "终于……你抵达了\r\n“梦之尽头”……",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_69_every_50km_event.txt/4": "一个未知的新世界\r\n在你眼前展开。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_69_every_50km_event.txt/5": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]朝着新世界\r\n迈出了第一步……",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_69_every_50km_event.txt/6": "……你终于走完了10,000 km。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_69_every_50km_event.txt/7": "一个未知的新世界\r\n在你眼前展开。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_69_every_50km_event.txt/8": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]朝着新世界\r\n迈出了第一步……",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_69_every_50km_event.txt/9": "康拉斯之子……听得见吗？\r\n请在越过标记之前收集梦幻石：\r\n\\c[52]2000 km\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_69_every_50km_event.txt/10": "你已经无法再\r\n连接各个世界了……",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_69_every_50km_event.txt/11": "接下来就看你了……",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_69_every_50km_event.txt/12": "你没有履行约定，\r\n便越过了2000 km……\r\n\\c[52]神秘贤者\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_6_darkness_barrier.txt/0": "光之巨人被闪耀的雾气包围。\r\n光芒夺目，令人无法看清\r\n它巨大的身形。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_76_delete_boss.txt/0": "\\>强烈的气息消散了……\r\n他似乎逃走了。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_80_dimension_area_start.txt/0": "那道强大的气息\r\n从\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]中\r\n似乎退到了更深的光里。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_80_dimension_area_start.txt/1": "看来已经无法再与\r\n\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]战斗了。",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_80_dimension_area_start.txt/2": "终于抵达了\r\n\\c[52]梦幻回廊\\c[0]。\r\n\\c[51]Pluton\\c[0]应该就在前方……",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_89_carelessly.txt/0": "好像有什么东西\r\n掉在很远的身后了。\r\n只能感叹一句“糟了！”……",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_96_demon_lord_delete_1h.txt/0": "距离\\c[51]堕天使\\c[0]离开还有1小时！",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_97_dimension_lord_delete_3h.txt/0": "距离\\c[51]Pluton\\c[0]消失还有1小时！",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_98_boss_pop_1h.txt/0": "一股巨大的能量正在逼近！\r\n\\c[52]1小时\\c[0]后，\\c[52]强敌\\c[0]\r\n与\\c[52]手下\\c[0]将会出现……",
  "message/data/event/timer/udb24_99_boss_delete_3h.txt/0": "距离强敌离开还有3小时！",
